  "classic_core_implementation_rule": "v1.200 Core/Src/UnClass.cpp and UnProp.cpp are last present classic source implementation in these eight named Unreal game source snapshots; v1.224 and v1.227 provide changed headers/declarations but no replacement implementations. Use this inherited implementation unless a later present source defines a different behavior. Do not make 2012 compiled 227i vs newer Core.lib mismatch into a prerequisite solely to use a missing file.",
